From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:18:59 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 64/85] Plutonium: wp_cursor_shape_v1, cursors by name for GTK
 4, Qt 6 and foot

Clients that speak wp_cursor_shape_v1 ask for a cursor by name instead
of drawing it from their own cursor theme, so their cursors match the
page's and follow its scale. Shapes map to Chrome's cursor types as
Ozone's Wayland client maps them the other way, and go through
Pointer::SetCursorType() as zcr_cursor_shapes_v1 does (so an embedded
window's cursor reaches the page). Version 1, pointers only: Exo has no
tablet tools.
